  description: Vampires are elegant undead predators, of medium human size, outwardly
    almost human with pale skin and predatory eyes. They are moving with fluid, predatory
    strides that can burst into supernatural speed when they choose. Unlike most
    undead, they use smooth, persuasive speech, charming or taunting their prey with
    perfectly formed words.
